itle\"><div class=\"legacy-copy\"><span class=\"label\">Why it matters</span><h2 id=\"legacy-title\">A small canvas.<br>A lasting language.</h2><p>This composition makes Mondrian’s search for harmony tangible: each line and rectangle changes how we experience the whole. It shows how a painting can move us through relationships alone. De Stijl carried that ambition across disciplines, helping make abstraction a language for modern life.</p></div><div class=\"invitation\"><span class=\"label\">Keep looking</span><h2>There’s more between<br>the lines.</h2><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://collection.kunsthaus.ch/en/collection/item/2455/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discover the original <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>
